                        <span style="color:blue;font-size:120%;">IFHE Hyderabad</span><br>
                        The ICFAI Foundation for Higher Education is a deemed University &nbsp;which is established under section 3 of UGC Act, 1956. It has evolved a comprehensive student-centric learning approach consisting of several stages, designed to add significant values to the learner's understanding in an integrated manner, covering relevant knowledge, practical skills and positive attitudes. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="http://www.ifheindia.org/">More....</a><br><br>
                    </div>
                </div><br>
